    "text": "By Gracie Kirschner ,\n19 hours ago DORCHESTER COUNTY, S.C. (WCSC) — First responders in South Carolina are training for one of the smallest and most critical patients they may ever treat: a newborn in distress. Dorchester County EMS crews are taking part in specialized neonatal resuscitation training this week through a program called NeoHero, which... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
